    "name": "Ironstorm Spearhead",
    "abilities": [
        {
            "id": "000008477",
            "name": "Armoured Wrath",
            "description": "Once per phase for each <span class=\"kwb\">ADEPTUS</span> <span class=\"kwb\">ASTARTES</span> unit in your army, you can re-roll one Hit roll, one Wound roll or one Damage roll made for a model in that unit.",
            "legend": "An Ironstorm Spearhead’s commanders guide their assault with pre-cogitated fire solutions, cycling data-gheist inloads and whispered binharic auguries. These ensure their warriors, and the belligerent machine spirits inhabiting their war engines, deliver their fire with inescapable accuracy.",
